{"3603110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Favela Kick: The Final Goal", "steam_appid": 3603110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you go from dusty streets to global superstardom?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Favela Kick: The Final Goal</strong>, you are a young boy born into poverty in Brazil with nothing but a dream and a talent for football. This is your story, your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Dream:</strong> Start as a kid playing in the favelas, get scouted, and rise through the ranks of Brazilian football.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Europe:</strong> Make your mark in the big leagues of France, England, and Spain. Can you become a world-class star?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Adversity:</strong> The path to glory is never easy. Face unexpected challenges and tough decisions that could change everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Glory:</strong> Lift your family out of hardship, chase the biggest trophies in club football, and fight for the ultimate honor with the Brazilian national team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Legacy Awaits:</strong> Experience the highs and lows of a football legend's career. Every match, every goal, every decision shapes your path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story-driven gameplay with impactful cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your player through multiple leagues and countries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dramatic moments of triumph and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, heartfelt pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your final kick be the one that defines a generation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey from nothing to legend starts now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localized to: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Italian, Indonesian, German, Turkish, Greek, Russian.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you go from dusty streets to global superstardom?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Favela Kick: The Final Goal</strong>, you are a young boy born into poverty in Brazil with nothing but a dream and a talent for football. This is your story, your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Dream:</strong> Start as a kid playing in the favelas, get scouted, and rise through the ranks of Brazilian football.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Europe:</strong> Make your mark in the big leagues of France, England, and Spain. Can you become a world-class star?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Adversity:</strong> The path to glory is never easy. Face unexpected challenges and tough decisions that could change everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Glory:</strong> Lift your family out of hardship, chase the biggest trophies in club football, and fight for the ultimate honor with the Brazilian national team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Legacy Awaits:</strong> Experience the highs and lows of a football legend's career. Every match, every goal, every decision shapes your path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story-driven gameplay with impactful cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your player through multiple leagues and countries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dramatic moments of triumph and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, heartfelt pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your final kick be the one that defines a generation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey from nothing to legend starts now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localized to: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Italian, Indonesian, German, Turkish, Greek, Russian.</p>", "short_description": "From favela streets to global superstardom! Live a young Brazilian's dream of football glory. Rise through leagues, face challenges, &amp; chase ultimate victory. Will your final kick define a generation? Your legend starts now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Indonesian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603110/33a118b6b39b56e11322d300e908a8d1f60acb37/header.jpg?t=1771757202", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603110/9401d77037500ce5b0802a505b1ac6482726ba65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771757202", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603110/9401d77037500ce5b0802a505b1ac6482726ba65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771757202", "website": "https://vladimirplyashkun.github.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10 capable<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor an